	'Kou watched the shadow'
	R
	'disappear.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_0462a:
	ZH 1:
	'But Nagatsune... I know that'
	R
	'you’re wrong...'
	\L_04733:
	ZH 1:
	'This is no simple dream...'
	\L_04733:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s something more important'
	R
	'than that...'
	\L_04733:
