*L_042c9:
	!VAR0516 : 1005!
	\L_0470a:
	\L_04646:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'    Osaka Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'     Kouhime’s Room'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	!VAR0516 : 25!
	\L_04662:
	\L_04646:
	ZH 1:
	'The fire in a paper lantern'
	R
	'swayed as its oil diminished.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_0460e:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah...'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_04646:
	ZH 1:
	'Kou sighed and put down her'
	R
	'writing brush.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_0467e:
	ZH 1:
	'Princess, please rest for the'
	R
	'night. Staying up this long is'
	R
	'bad for your health.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_0460e:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re the one that should'
	R
	'rest, Nagatsune. I’ll be'
	R
	'continuing for a bit longer.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_04646:
	ZH 1:
	'Someone was behind the sliding'
	R
	'door. It was Nagatsune, the'
	R
	'nanny that cared for Kou since'
	R
	'her birth.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_0467e:
	ZH 1:
	'Princess, is that a letter to'
	R
	'the lord?'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_0460e:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... I know that we were'
	R
	'defeated again, Nagatsune.'
	\L_04733:
	ZH 1:
	'But I want to do something.'
	R
	'If I can’t, I...'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_0467e:
	ZH 1:
	'Princess.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_04646:
	ZH 1:
	'Nagatsune chided Kou in a'
	R
	'mildly strong tone.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_0467e:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s not true that the lord'
	R
	'doesn’t care about the country.'
	R
	'Rather, he’s looking to expand'
	R
	'it.'
	\L_04733:
	ZH 1:
	'You most likely aren’t able to'
	R
	'see the effects of that now.'
	\L_04733:
	ZH 1:
	'But eventually it will be good'
	R
	'for the people. If you, the'
	R
	'princess, won’t believe that,'
	R
	'who will...?'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_0460e:
	ZH 1:
	'I know, Nagatsune.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_04646:
	ZH 1:
	'Kou picked up her writing'
	R
	'brush again.'
	\L_04733:
	ZH 1:
	'The shadow moving behind the'
	R
	'sliding door probably noticed'
	R
	'when she did. Nagatsune sighed.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_0467e:
	ZH 1:
	'Try not to strain yourself too'
	R
	'much...'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_04646:
	ZH 1:
	'Quiet footsteps left through'
	R
	'the hall.'
	\L_04733:
	\L_04726:
	\L_04646:
	ZH 1:
	'The writing brush glided over'
	R
	'the white paper. Kou’s heart'
	R
	'materialized as black'
	R
	'characters on the page.'
	\L_04733:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　Please end this war...'
	\L_04733:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　Please let the soldiers'
	R
	' return home to their'
	R
	' families...'
	\L_04733:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　Please lower the taxes...'
	\L_04733:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　Please give the castle’s'
	R
	' reserves to the people'
	R
	' suffering from famine...'
	\L_04733:
